            "text": "The Train song Mermaid had been released under the Sony Music Entertainment and Columbia record labels The song lasts 3.16 minutes and is in the reggae genre. It was produced by the Espionage production team and was followed by the band\u2019s cover of the John Lennon song Imagine."
