            "text": "Mermaid, the song by Train, was released on the Sony Music Entertainment and Columbia Records record labels and was produced by the Espionage production team. It has a total runtime of three minutes and sixteen seconds and is in the reggae music genre. The song\u2018s release was followed by the release of the band\u2019s cover of the John Lennon song Imagine."
